        "description": "<div\n    x-data=\"{ \n        jsonData: JSON.parse('{&quot;images&quot;:[&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/3db8ccb6-6c0b-4493-b596-2f559d2261d6.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/385a1b26-b869-4708-8fec-06461dcc9845.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/665c697f-0fab-4c35-ab82-90a6dceb58ec.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/8502af58-c0fc-4f33-89a7-ebf1e75cfe91.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/9290c282-7528-454d-bfb6-edd41772e847.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/9672f540-f6b4-4d4e-aa73-06f0194d6917.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/9709c378-71fa-4f92-856c-f02f85240f96.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/7757276b-daa3-4d5e-8334-52afecb58dce.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/a07a4cd0-114d-421f-a413-025685485cff.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/b30315d9-54bb-42e7-b2da-610113d14bfd.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/f640f71f-669e-4b2e-b2d3-17f3ec1e187d.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/f55972a6-a8ce-4aa8-9743-6e213056f7d4.jpeg&quot;,&quot;https:\\/\\/snappysnail.io\\/img\\/services\\/faf73648-16a9-4e85-9bec-ccff55a924a6.jpeg&quot;],&quot;labels&quot;:[&quot;Sviluppo Web&quot;,&quot;Landing Page&quot;,&quot;Outsourcing&quot;,&quot;Consulenza&quot;]}'),\n        tilesIndexes: [],\n        theChosenOne: 0,\n        shuffleTiles() {\n            this.tilesIndexes = Array.from({length: this.jsonData.images.length + this.jsonData.labels.length}, (_, i) => i + 1);\n            this.tilesIndexes.sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);\n            this.theChosenOne = this.tilesIndexes[this.tilesIndexes.length - 1];\n        }\n    }\" x-init=\"shuffleTiles\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-16\" @scroll.window.throttle=\"shuffleTiles\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"mb-8\">Cosa faccio</h2>\n            <p>Sviluppo siti web, landing page e applicazioni web, e aiuto le aziende occupandomi in outsourcing dei loro progetti esistenti, fornendo consulenza e prendendomi cura delle loro esigenze di sviluppo web.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"mb-8\">Servizi</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-6 gap-4\">\n                <template x-for=\"(image, index) in jsonData.images\" :key=\"index\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 w-full h-auto aspect-[1/1] transition-[order] rounded-lg overflow-clip\" :style=\"{order:(tilesIndexes[index] - 1)}\" :class=\"{ 'col-span-2': index === theChosenOne }\">\n                        <img :src=\"image\" alt=\"Services\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full\">\n                    </div>\n                </template>\n                <template x-for=\"(label, index) in jsonData.labels\" :key=\"index\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 p-2 lg:p-4text-center w-full h-auto aspect-[1/1] rounded-lg overflow-clip grid place-items-center\" :style=\"{order:(tilesIndexes[index + jsonData.images.length] - 1)}\" :class=\"{ 'col-span-2': index + jsonData.images.length === theChosenOne }\">\n                        <label x-text=\"label\" class=\"break-words text-xs lg:text-lg\"></label>\n                    </div>\n                </template>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
